        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;November: Review Statistics &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Analyze Tools&lt;/b&gt;: 8 Wastes, Fishbone Diagram, 5 Whys, Pareto Chart&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Quality Statistics&lt;/b&gt;: Normal Distribution, Hypothesis Testing (p-value, Type I/II errors), Process Capability (Cp, Cpk)" mermaidId="n:M11" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="&lt;b&gt;11 月：統計與分析複習&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Analyze 工具：&lt;/b&gt;8大浪費、魚骨圖、5 Whys、Pareto&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;品管統計：&lt;/b&gt;常態分佈、假設檢定 (p-value, Type I/II)、製程能力 (Cp, Cpk)" id="Usfgp-9FF6Dvez-TIk3X-90">
